      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMose wasekhuluma lezinhloko zezizwe zabakoIsrayeli, wathi: Yilokhu iNkosi elaye ngakho ukuthi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nxa umuntu ethembisa isithembiso eNkosini, loba efunga isifungo, ezibopha ngesibambiso, kangephuli ilizwi lakhe; umele ukwenza konke akuthembisileyo ngomlomo wakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.23.21+DEU.23.22+DEU.23.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dute 23:21–23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.5.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 5:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi nxa owesifazana efunga isifungo eNkosini, azibophe ngesibambiso esemutsha, esesemzini kayise, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loyise ezwe ngesifungo sakhe langesibambiso sakhe azibophe ngaso, kodwa engatsho lutho kuye, zonke izifungo zakhe zizakuma, lazo zonke izibambiso azibophe ngazo zizasebenza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwake uba uyise, ekuzweni kwakhe lokho, emtshela ukuthi kavumi, kakuyikusebenza lesisodwa sezifungo zakhe lesisodwa sezibambiso azibophe ngazo; leNkosi izakumyekela, ngoba uyise engavumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uba owesifazana esenda esazibophe ngesifungo sakhe, loba esazibophe ngesithembiso asithembise ngokungananzeleli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lendoda yakhe ibisikuzwa, kodwa ingatsho lutho kuye lapho ikuzwa lokho, izithembiso zakhe zizakusebenza, lezibambiso azibophe ngazo zizakusebenza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwake uba indoda yakhe imtshela lapho ikuzwa ukuthi kayivumi, izakwenza isifungo asenzileyo sibe yize, lesithembiso asithembise ngokungananzeleli azibophe ngaso, sibe yize; leNkosi izakumyekela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa isifungo somfelwakazi loba isifungo sowehlukene lendoda yakhe, lakho konke azibophe ngakho, kuzakusebenza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uba enzile isithembiso endlini yendoda yakhe, loba efungile isifungo, ezibophile ngesibambiso, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lendoda yakhe ibisikuzwa, kodwa ingatsho lutho kuye, ingamaleli, zonke izifungo zakhe zizakusebenza, lazo zonke izibambiso azibophe ngazo zizakusebenza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uba indoda yakhe izala lapho izizwa, konke akutshoyo kakuyikusebenza, loba izithembiso zakhe loba izibambiso zakhe; indoda yakhe izalile, leNkosi izakumyekela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zonke izifungo lazo zonke izithembiso zokuzithoba, indoda yakhe ingazivuma loba izale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uba indoda yakhe ingatsho lutho kuye ngalolosuku langosuku olulandelayo, lokhu kutsho ukuthi iyazivuma zonke izifungo zakhe lazo zonke izibambiso zakhe; impela izivumile, ngoba kayitshongo lutho lapho izizwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uba izala lapho isizizwile, izakuba lomlandu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lezi yizimiso iNkosi eyamlaya zona uMose mayelana lomuntu lomkakhe, loyise lendodakazi yakhe isentsha emzini kayise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
